                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does an on-demand app cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹40-90 lakh ($48K-108K). Growth: ₹1-2.2 Cr ($120K-265K). Enterprise multi-country: ₹3-6 Cr ($360K-720K).</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest failure mode?</h3>
                                        <p>Weak partner side. Consumer app can be excellent but if you don't have enough quality-vetted providers with predictable earnings, the marketplace collapses. Solve supply first.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build a super-app or focus on one category?</h3>
                                        <p>Start narrow — one category, one city — and expand. Super-app strategies almost always fail at the start.</p>
                                        <h3>What commission rate should I target?</h3>
                                        <p>20-30% gross commission is standard; 15-25% net after partner incentives. Below 15% net, unit economics rarely work at scale.</p>
